# Force LF line endings on all text files so a Windows checkout doesn't
# trip rustfmt's `newline_style = "Unix"` (src-tauri/rustfmt.toml). Without
# this, Windows git default `core.autocrlf=true` rewrites .rs files to
# CRLF on checkout and `cargo fmt --check` fails in CI.
*           text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets — never normalize.
*.png       binary
*.ico       binary
*.icns      binary
*.jpg       binary
*.jpeg      binary
*.gif       binary
*.webp      binary
*.woff      binary
*.woff2     binary
*.ttf       binary
*.otf       binary
*.zip       binary
*.gz        binary
*.tar       binary
